		{
			dependencies: ["6F5AFD21317A97EE"]
			description: ["&fThe Void Blossom is the newest boss added to the mod, lurking in rare caves near the lowest depths of the world. You can track down the right cave by following the direction shown by nearby Void Lilies, which quietly point the way to its lair. This boss is protected by a permanent Thorns effect and has several dangerous abilities. It can summon thorn bushes that damage you on contact, regenerate health from nearby Void Blossoms that you must destroy, and fill the arena with poisonous green clouds. Once you finally bring it down, you will be rewarded with Crystal Fruit and a deadly Void Thorn for your efforts."]
